{"3589510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Returns Outlet Simulator", "steam_appid": 3589510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Returns Outlet Simulator is a relaxed first-person simulation where every aspect of operating your own shop springs to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/11dec2b132ac9b6c276afdd981d54caf.poster.avif?t=1786723498\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/11dec2b132ac9b6c276afdd981d54caf.webm?t=1786723498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/11dec2b132ac9b6c276afdd981d54caf.mp4?t=1786723498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>SUPPLY RETURNS PALLETS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game computer to order returns pallets. Unpack them, arrange them in your storage area, and stock them on shelves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/5b6b2be6f9a7fdef7cc5473bf2962cc1.poster.avif?t=1786723498\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/5b6b2be6f9a7fdef7cc5473bf2962cc1.webm?t=1786723498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/5b6b2be6f9a7fdef7cc5473bf2962cc1.mp4?t=1786723498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>STORE MANAGEMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your store layout, balancing functionality and visual appeal. Decide product placement, organize your aisles, and guarantee a seamless shopping journey for your patrons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/e28c53637e71fd7876ee820374391037.poster.avif?t=1786723498\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/e28c53637e71fd7876ee820374391037.webm?t=1786723498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/e28c53637e71fd7876ee820374391037.mp4?t=1786723498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>BE A CASHIER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan products, process cash transactions, and make sure customers are happy with their shopping and payment experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/cb5ef5697a0216f97b9c5f443c4aa5ce.poster.avif?t=1786723498\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/cb5ef5697a0216f97b9c5f443c4aa5ce.webm?t=1786723498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/cb5ef5697a0216f97b9c5f443c4aa5ce.mp4?t=1786723498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>GROW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With growing profits, think about reinvesting. Increase your store's size, enhance the interior design, and consistently adjust to the changing needs of the retail industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/b97b33272bcefb835d66a7db926acf34.poster.avif?t=1786723498\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/b97b33272bcefb835d66a7db926acf34.webm?t=1786723498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/b97b33272bcefb835d66a7db926acf34.mp4?t=1786723498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>CUSTOMIZE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your store one-of-a-kind with personal touches. Adjust the flooring, paint the walls and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/1077c314b35875839de007dbd1a8fbfe.poster.avif?t=1786723498\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/1077c314b35875839de007dbd1a8fbfe.webm?t=1786723498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/1077c314b35875839de007dbd1a8fbfe.mp4?t=1786723498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>In &quot;Returns Outlet Simulator&quot; every choice you make has an impact. Can you step up, turning a small shop into a retail giant while juggling customer happiness and financial stability?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Returns Outlet Simulator is a relaxed first-person simulation where every aspect of operating your own shop springs to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/11dec2b132ac9b6c276afdd981d54caf.poster.avif?t=1786723498\" width=616 height=210 ><source sr