team/apps/3589510/extras/e28c53637e71fd7876ee820374391037.mp4?t=1786723498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>BE A CASHIER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan products, process cash transactions, and make sure customers are happy with their shopping and payment experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/cb5ef5697a0216f97b9c5f443c4aa5ce.poster.avif?t=1786723498\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/cb5ef5697a0216f97b9c5f443c4aa5ce.webm?t=1786723498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/cb5ef5697a0216f97b9c5f443c4aa5ce.mp4?t=1786723498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>GROW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With growing profits, think about reinvesting. Increase your store's size, enhance the interior design, and consistently adjust to the changing needs of the retail industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/b97b33272bcefb835d66a7db926acf34.poster.avif?t=1786723498\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/b97b33272bcefb835d66a7db926acf34.webm?t=1786723498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/b97b33272bcefb835d66a7db926acf34.mp4?t=1786723498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>CUSTOMIZE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your store one-of-a-kind with personal touches. Adjust the flooring, paint the walls and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/1077c314b35875839de007dbd1a8fbfe.poster.avif?t=1786723498\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/1077c314b35875839de007dbd1a8fbfe.webm?t=1786723498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/extras/1077c314b35875839de007dbd1a8fbfe.mp4?t=1786723498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>In &quot;Returns Outlet Simulator&quot; every choice you make has an impact. Can you step up, turning a small shop into a retail giant while juggling customer happiness and financial stability?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Returns Outlet Simulator is a relaxed first-person simulation where every aspect of operating your own shop springs to life.", "supported_languages": "English, Polish, French, Italian, German, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian, Danish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Hungarian, Spanish - Spain, Norwegian, Swedish, Czech, Greek, Japanese, Romanian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/d9abb21482dceab7f1ef428fd505e9142aab2bef/header.jpg?t=1786723498", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/956c49e1e691bc3dc0d7162cbe64b2d0d4afb95d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786723498", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589510/956c49e1e691bc3dc0d7162cbe64b2d0d4afb95d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786723498", "website": "https://returnsoutletsimulator.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><